{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_03_beg","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":6,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_02_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-3","storyName":"破手铐","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"纳乔为阿奎拉被捕一事向互助会求助，与奥卢斯相遇。克莱门莎决定与卡门商议岛民问题的解决方法，而卡门也下定决心要改革审判庭。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_03_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_03_beg","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":4,"next":6,"characters":["克莱门莎","德鲁莎","惩戒军士官","斐戴拉","阿奎拉","纳乔","奥卢斯","塔西塔","圣徒卡门","艾丽妮"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_bg_74_g5_gdsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"阿奎拉被捕了？","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"她利用船厂的骚乱在人群中进行交易，我用了点小方法，把她和同伙引到了方便动手的地方。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"可惜，她已完成交易，现在正在接受审讯，我应该插不了手。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"阿奎拉的意志很坚定，我担心盲目审讯，效果会适得其反。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"这次交易显然是在为了之后的行动做准备，但目前为止她没有交代任何信息。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"我会顺着互助会的线索继续追查，希望能在未知的威胁来临之前找到些头绪。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"不过，我必须提醒你，这次行动牵扯的岛民可不止阿奎拉一个。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"……","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"就算审判庭想要维稳，也不可能无视放在台面上的危险。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"这件事我会想办法处理。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"如我之前所说，大规模搜查会妨碍打捞计划，更重要的是会再次激起伊比利亚人对岛民的愤懑。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"调和岛民与伊比利亚人的矛盾是我与伊比利亚阁下共同的愿望，岛民伤害伊比利亚的利益实则也是在伤害他们自身。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"如果不能打破恶性循环，即使雷亚-伊比利亚重回海岸线也无法将伊比利亚人凝聚在一起。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"唉，圣徒阁下可是交给了你一件难事。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我本就无法忽视任何一个求助的人。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"……","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你可以说我傲慢。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"我不骂自讨苦吃的人。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"对了，阿奎拉被捕时托我转交一件东西，审判庭检查之后没有发现危险，我就带来了。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"all","id":45},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"纳乔丢的螺栓……她在海里找到的？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"和假肢上的其他零件都不一样，它看起来像是黄金时代的旧物。也难怪纳乔那么惦记它……","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"阿奎拉对同胞的关怀确实不假。那么有毅力的人，何苦要走歪路？岛民和伊比利亚的积怨真是消磨人啊。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"……","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"charslot","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":58},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_bg_74_g2_courtprison.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armour","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"大审判官阁下，人带到了。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"还需要我们做什么吗？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"charslot","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"去船厂驻守吧，然后给艾丽妮带一条口信，就说……我的伤情又严重了，身体不适。如果今天圣徒阁下有事要商谈，请她代我前往。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"是。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armour","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":78},{"type":"charslot","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#5$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"审判官对自己的同僚竟然也会说谎，这倒是让我舒心了一些——你们不是只在岛民问题上编故事。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"不用挑衅我。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我处理过太多深海教徒和普通岛民，无辜的、仇恨的、发疯的……几乎什么都见过了。所以我也知道该怎么对待你们。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"可以说，我比你们还要了解你们自己。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#8$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"你怎么敢……！","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我并不是想要侮辱你们，不过只有这样，我才能不犯错。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我对岛民并无恨意，让无辜之人枉死只会玷污我对伊比利亚崇高德行的坚守。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"在船厂，我逐渐明白了一些道理——有些船哪怕修补好了，也是无法在海上航行的。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"审判庭早就注意到了互助会的动向，只是你们的集会一直非常隐蔽，隐蔽到我开始怀疑是否有人在用独特的法术替你们遮掩。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"今天终于能跟你们好好聊一聊了。告诉我，你们到底想做什么？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"charslot","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":98},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_bg_74_g3_seasidest_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"0","to":"0.8","block":"true","id":101},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":102,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldman_walk","id":103},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"5","randomness":"10","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"1.1","id":105},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"5","randomness":"10","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1.1","id":107},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"5","randomness":"10","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"1.1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"互助会的教堂……阿奎拉告诉我的应该就是这个街区，到底在哪儿……","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"唔……","id":111},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","id":113},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":116},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0","id":117},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0","id":118},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"44_g13_afterglow_L1/44_g13_afterglow_R1/44_g13_afterglow_L2/44_g13_afterglow_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","y":"500","id":119},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"60","yFrom":"700","yTo":"500","block":"false","x":"-1280","id":120},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"text","text":"困惑、慌乱、悲哀、愤怒的心情被困在纳乔的身体之中，让他忽视了自己手臂的伤口已经进一步恶化。","id":123},{"type":"text","text":"他想知道阿奎拉为什么宁愿拼命也不愿意安安稳稳地生活下去，他想让纷争消失在伊比利亚，他想找到所有问题的解决方法。","id":124},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gateopen","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":127},{"type":"text","text":"一扇门，为疑惑、困苦、向往和平的阿戈尔人打开。","id":128},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"（意识模糊）教堂……","id":131},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"终于见到你了，纳乔。别担心，我是阿奎拉的导师，我会帮助你。","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gatecloz","id":135},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"gridbg","id":139},{"type":"curtain","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":141},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_74_g11_clmsoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"您终于回来了，技术工阿奎拉——","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我已经知道了。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"您知道了？您是遇到纳乔了吗？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"纳乔？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"阿奎拉出事后他想找您帮忙，但看您不在就离开了。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"派小帮手去找找他，打捞中心的人不能再出意外了。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"……","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"审判庭已经带走了更多人？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"暂时还没有，但您自己看吧。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"阿奎拉、索莱达、马修、盖乌斯……审判庭传来的调查名单涉及了打捞中心三分之一的工作人员，而且全是阿戈尔人。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"阿奎拉的案件已经牵扯进许多岛民，您明白处理他们的问题存在外交风险。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"哪怕你我都能猜到，审判庭其实需要通过这次外交合作解决他们与岛民的矛盾？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"我并不认为陆上的人有足够的理性，能在直接面对这种情况的时候，不把阿戈尔的举动理解为“插手他们的家务事”。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"那关于岛民本身，你是怎么想的？","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"请恕我直言，对于选择前往陆地的同胞，阿戈尔接受他们的选择，但也达成了一个共识——他们需要承担选择的结果。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"而现在，他们的后代在伊比利亚生活已久，他们习惯了伊比利亚的行事风格，对阿戈尔的制度和理念没有丝毫认知。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"既然如此，我们为什么要强行以同胞的身份干预他们和伊比利亚的矛盾？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"那只会显得阿戈尔之前所有的宽容，都只是因为没有亲眼见过这些岛民真实的遭遇。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你认为我过于同情岛民的遭遇，而同情是不合时宜的，是吗？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"……","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"是的。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"第一批离开本境的阿戈尔人为何上岸？","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"海嗣侵蚀了他们的家园，他们是……难民。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"阿戈尔无法否认，它没有保护好自己的人民，更别提像科学发展规划所标榜的那样——“给予每位公民选择”。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"正因如此，我才没法打着“尊重”的旗号，对他们的境遇坐视不理。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我们对阿戈尔的诸多事宜都有截然不同的看法，塔西塔。我不会要求你认同我的观点，甚至我认为，你不应该认同阿戈尔给出的观点。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"只要有怀疑，只要有猜想，你都可以去消除、去验证，我会支持。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"但同情不会是不合时宜的，哪怕从理性出发，同情也是一种全新的思路——让人不至于因为自傲而找错解法的思路。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"我明白……不，我会再思考一下。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"嗯，去吧。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":202},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"1","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephonebusy","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ringoff","channel":"2","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"别来无恙，伊比利亚阁下。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"在打捞启动仪式上，您曾隐晦地认同，以我为代表的阿戈尔方有权参与处理岛民问题。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"是的，我已经决定了。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"虽然涉及外交层面的说辞难免遭人曲解，我个人也倾向于直面问题而非回避……","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"但我希望那些已经疲于应付纷争的岛民能有一次选择的机会——","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"选择留在伊比利亚，或者回到阿戈尔。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#7$1","id":221},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_bg_74_g1_cmoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":222},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephone","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"……","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":227},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"圣徒阁下。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"斐戴拉大审判官呢？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9d/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"大审判官阁下的伤势又重了，向船厂告了假，她让我代她赴约。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"斐戴拉，我的学生……哪怕关于未来的许诺放在她面前，她还是会怀疑。不过，这样也好。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"您的意思是，大审判官阁下其实不想来港都外围城区？","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"不，她一边相信着伊比利亚的明天，一边又害怕它会背叛她。她不愿接受我的劝诫，也不愿听更复杂的解释。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"圣徒阁下，斐戴拉大审判官太疲倦了，如果她的决心发生动摇，我……抱歉，我认为是完全可以理解的。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"她的决心从未动摇过，艾丽妮。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"这才是她今天没有来的原因。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"那我……","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"你知道我刚刚在跟谁通话？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"应该是克莱门莎监事，想来是为了技术工阿奎拉被逮捕的事。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"你如何看待她的举动？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"我曾在弥利亚留姆询问阿戈尔人对岛民问题的看法。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"他们十分理性地表示理解，那种状态甚至很难被称为“谅解”，而是一种另类的“不关心”。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"因此我认为，克莱门莎监事插手伊比利亚的岛民问题大概率是她的个人决定。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"你觉得这样的个人决定是否违背阿戈尔的意志？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"如果她的意志能引领阿戈尔走向更远的未来，那她的意志也可能成为阿戈尔的意志。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"……","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"点亮提灯，艾丽妮。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"是。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"圣徒阁下，我们要往哪走？","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"往下走。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","id":281},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"我成为审判官的那天，来过这里。我还记得里面关押的那只海嗣。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"每位审判官在成为审判官前，都要见它一面。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"达里奥只是冷冷地看着它，像看一具尸体。斐戴拉当场就拔出剑来要杀了它，如果不是我拦下了她，这只海嗣早就已经死了。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"最终，他们的结论都和你一样——它是敌人。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"它在这里被关押了多久？","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"在这里，六十三年，但如果要追溯它来到伊比利亚的时间，则近百年。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"黄金时代就有海嗣作乱了吗？","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"作乱？不。它曾是斯图提斐拉最珍贵的战利品，伊比利亚伟大征服的象征。老国王特地选在亲王的命名日那天为它揭幕。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"他甚至命令术师们在它身上刻写炼金术式，把它置于造船厂的核心，让它成为驱动这座精密而庞大的都城的重要力量。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"等等……这只海嗣曾在造船厂，用于驱动雷亚-伊比利亚，那……","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"我调派斐戴拉管理船厂的目的之一是为了让她休养，而另一个目的，就是将这只海嗣重新安置进船厂——这是打捞中心城区的一环。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"我不明白……","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"如果您让斐戴拉大审判官管理船厂，本意应该就是想让她知晓这些过往。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"这只海嗣她也曾见过，您无需担心她无法完成接收它的任务，可您为什么又说大审判官阁下不来也好？","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"因为关于这只海嗣的故事，在大静谧之后，还有后续。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"向下看，艾丽妮。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":309},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"charslot","id":313},{"type":"background","id":314},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_74_i06_1.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":315},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"30","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$chenandwei_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14d0d0/m_avg_chenandwei_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":318,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"大静谧时，我与我的一位同僚从港都带走了这只海嗣。不是为了缅怀什么，而是为了知晓我们即将面临的，究竟是什么。","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"多么讽刺，我们曾经对它视若珍宝，后来对它恨之入骨，但最后，还是要借助它来照亮前路。","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"您从不会对我们使用虚无缥缈的修辞。“照亮前路”……您指的就是我们的灯火？但，怎么可能？","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"点亮你手里那盏灯的，仍是你坚定不移的信念。几个月前，你在斯图提斐拉号上就已经证明了这一点。","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"但信念本身不过是一些抽象的道理。真正使它不朽的，永远是人的爱憎。","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"……就如同老师深爱着这片土地。","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"以及，憎恨着海嗣。","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"嵌在那盏灯里的施术单元，没法辨别你的信条，但它读得到你最炽烈的爱憎之情。","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"大静谧之后，伊比利亚人连直视大海都会感到恐惧，更妄论剿灭海嗣。","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"审判庭选拔出意志最为坚韧的士兵，也应给他们足够称手的武器，我们需要建立对抗大海的手段，哪怕它来自那片海本身。","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"所以“审判官必须直面海嗣”同样也不是一种虚无缥缈的修辞——","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"因为我们必须理解它，然后选择憎恨它，法术才能被维系，灯火才会被点亮。","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"是。","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"如果今后它作为雷亚-伊比利亚的核心，那……","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"维系灯火的法术不会立刻受到影响，不过会在不久之后彻底失去它们原本的效用。","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"从它重回船厂的那一刻起，与灯火连接紧密的审判官们便会感觉意志被微微摇动，正如海风中的烛火。","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"这将是他们决心成为审判官之后不得不经历的，第二次考验。","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"……","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"你可以质疑我，甚至直接在这里挑战我。","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"在同意实施打捞计划的那一刻，我已经想好了一切后果，包括我要承担的，和伊比利亚要承担的。","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"圣徒阁下，我只是在想，我明白了您刚刚在办公室里问我的话。","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"如果克莱门莎监事的意志有可能变成阿戈尔意志的一部分，那对于伊比利亚而言，从今往后照亮前路的，也未必只能是审判庭。","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"……","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"而且，我想起了另一件事。","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"在遇到达里奥老师之前，我只是个普通孩子，受了点训练，甚至没在惩戒军中服役过。","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"老师总说我太虔诚、太忠心，太相信审判庭的经文与律法就是我的一切……在老师眼里，那是我最大的弱点。","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"他希望我的正义能扎根于我双眼见过的景色、双耳听过的话语、双脚走过的土地，而非经文与律法。","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"我希望所有伊比利亚人都能如此。","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"这些人，哪怕只是为了不那么痛苦地吞咽那些石头似的鳞干，都需要在心中默念经文。","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"但也是这些人，会不自觉地跟着路边一个孩童唱起不成调子的船歌。","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"伊比利亚人，应当有在夜晚独自行走的权利，灯火不应该只属于审判庭。","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"如今，阿戈尔在前线为伊比利亚带来了喘息的机会，过去百年的经验在警告我，伊比利亚的时间一向十分宝贵。","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"把这只海嗣带走。然后，如在伊比利亚的每一天一样，做好准备。","id":352},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_match","id":355},{"type":"image","id":356},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_062cg_phantom_front","layer":"1","y":"0","x":"-250","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":359},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_74_i06_2.png","xScale":"1.4","yScale":"1.4","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","y":"100","x":"-150","id":360},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.4","yScaleFrom":"1.4","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"40","yTo":"0","xTo":"0","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":362},{"type":"bgeffect","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"圣徒划亮一根火柴，它的光芒明亮、耀眼，与审判庭的粉色灯火相比，毫不逊色。","id":365},{"type":"text","text":"火光映亮了海嗣交缠的、可怖的触肢，而它很快就要离开审判庭的牢笼，回到那座造船厂，回到它原本被关押的地方。","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"艾丽妮无法确定，没有法术维系的灯火是否依旧能抵挡海嗣。她更不确定的是，等到灯火熄灭时，审判庭的信仰是否会遭受动摇。","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"但至少，艾丽妮可以确定自己不会。","id":368},{"type":"text","text":"她见过战死在灯塔之下的达里奥，她也见过内向但坚韧的乔迪，她知道伊比利亚人可以做到更多，只是黑夜笼罩了他们太久。","id":369},{"type":"text","text":"她相信圣徒阁下的判断。更重要的是，在亲眼看过、亲身经历过之后，她也相信自己的判断。","id":370},{"type":"dialog","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"bgeffect","id":374},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":375},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":376},{"type":"image","id":377},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":378}],"characters":["克莱门莎","德鲁莎","惩戒军士官","斐戴拉","阿奎拉","纳乔","奥卢斯","塔西塔","圣徒卡门","艾丽妮"]}